WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.880
WOMAN: Why don't you write it under your real name?

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.540
Your superiors are going to fire you

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.080
unless I tell them to do otherwise.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.920
MAN: You're going to give her to someone else?

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.800
I created her

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.200
She is a smash success because of me

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.820
WOMAN: I wonder if you're the one with the secret identity

